# Never commit clinical source material to this repository.
# The system is designed to operate without retaining source documents (constraint C5).
# The repository must reflect that.
*.dcm
*.pdf
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
!docs/**/*.png

# The social card the landing page points at from og:image. It has to be committed and served
# from Pages, because a scraper cannot read a file that only exists on somebody's laptop, and
# og:image is ignored unless it resolves to an absolute URL. It contains no clinical material.
!og-card.png

# The generated document PDFs are deliberately NOT committed. They are build
# artifacts, regenerable from the Markdown with `cd tools && npm run pdf`, and
# archived with a DOI on Zenodo, which is their canonical home.
# Uncomment to ship them in the repo as well.
# !CONCEPT_NOTE.pdf
# !OBLIGATION_SPEC.pdf

# Intermediate render step, never archived.
*.build.html
data/
corpus/
mimic/
phi/

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem

# Tooling
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
